    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: ef78cac8 -->\n**Delta review (M5, since ae628c2f): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nef78cac8 does all three requested changes, in `pocket3d_hsm.rs` and the decision file only:\n- The fallback set is pinned exactly: `levels == [\"10.000\", \"20.000\"]` (sorted).\n- `arcs == 222`.\n- Moves are in `6450..=6560` and planar in `6414..=6524`, about ±50 around both measured platforms (6500/6503 and 6464/6467).\n\nThe safety assertions from the reviewed head are unchanged: it verifies clean, there's no budget refusal, and each rings level is named. The author reports the heavy test passing on macOS with clippy clean; my run at ae628c2f measured 6503/6467/222 on macOS, inside the new bands.\n",
