    "body": "This conflicts with `main` (label `conflicts`; your 04:14 overlap note already frames it): #1032 merged at a6bd69d8 and re-pins the same assertions in `crates/app/tests/pocket3d_hsm.rs` - `fell.is_empty()` with per-platform exact counts now stands where this branch's bands were. Please merge current `upstream/main` and re-work the pins against it (both sides changed the same logic here, so a mechanical keep-both is not right). If #1032 turned out to supersede this PR's ask entirely, say so and release the issue instead. Heads-up for any sim/verify calls this test touches: `VerifyContext` gained `model_excess` (#911) - construct with `..Default::default()`.\n",
